  "evidence": [
    {
      "signal": "pla",
      "summary": "CASI describes the Rocket Force University of Engineering in Xi’an, which has trained strategic missile personnel since 1959 and took its present name in 2016, as the PLA Rocket Force’s engineering university: its colleges include missile engineering and nuclear engineering, its facilities include a field missile training ground, the force’s missile weapons and equipment and five military key laboratories, and most of the force’s brigade commanders, chiefs of staff and chief engineers are its graduates. Canada’s Named Research Organizations list gives Xi’an Research Institute of High Technology among its known aliases.",
